  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umfana uSamuweli wayesebenzela iNkosi ngaphansi kukaEli. Ilizwi leNkosi lalingandanga ngalezonsuku, lombono ungekho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalesosikhathi uEli wayelele endaweni yakhe lamehlo akhe ayesaqala ukufiphala engasaboni kuhle; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "isibane sikaNkulunkulu sasingakacinywa, uSamuweli wayelele ethempelini leNkosi, lapho kwakukhona umtshokotsho ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " sikaNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yammemeza, yathi: Samuweli, Samuweli! Yena wathi: Ngilapha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wagijimela kuEli, wathi: Sengifikile, ngoba ungibizile. Yena wathi: Angikubizanga; buyela ulale. Wasehamba, walala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yabuya yamemeza futhi, yathi: Samuweli! USamuweli wavuka, waya kuEli, wathi: Sengifikile, ngoba ungibizile. Kodwa yena wathi: Angikubizanga, mntanami; buyela ulale futhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wayengakayazi iNkosi, lelizwi leNkosi wayengakalambulelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yambiza futhi uSamuweli ngokwesithathu. Wavuka waya kuEli wathi: Sengifikile, ngoba sibili ungibizile. UEli wasebona ukuthi iNkosi iyambiza umfana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uEli wasesithi kuSamuweli: Hamba uyelala: lapho ubizwa futhi uzakuthi: Khuluma Nkosi, ngoba inceku yakho iyezwa. Wasehamba uSamuweli, wayalala endaweni yakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yafika, yema, yamemeza njengakwezinye izikhathi, yathi: Samuweli, Samuweli! Yena wathi: Khuluma, ngoba inceku yakho iyezwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kuSamuweli: Khangela, sengizakwenza into koIsrayeli ezabanda indlebe zombili zalabo abayizwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalolosuku ngizakwenza kuEli konke engakukhuluma ngendlu yakhe, kusukela ekuqaleni kuze kufike ekucineni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umtshele ukuthi sengizakuyijezisa indlu yakhe kokuphela, ngoba kwathi esazi ukuthi amadodana akhe ayehlambaza uNkulunkulu, kawakhuzanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke ngiyafunga kuyo indlu kaEli ukuthi ububi bayo kabuyikuhlanjululwa ngomhlatshelo langomnikelo kuze kube nini lanini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli walala kwaze kwasa; wasevula iminyango yendlu yeNkosi, kodwa wesaba ukumtshela uEli ngombono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEli wambiza uSamuweli, wathi: Samuweli, mntanami. Yena wathi: Ngilapha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEli wathi: INkosi itheni kuwe na? Ungangifihleli; uNkulunkulu akuhlanekele ngokwengezelelweyo, uba ungifihlela konke akutshele khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uSamuweli wasemtshela konke, kazamfihlela lutho. Yena wathi: YiNkosi, kayenze lokho ekubona kulungile kuyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakhulake uSamuweli; iNkosi yayilaye, kakuwelanga phansi lelilodwa ilizwi lakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonke uIsrayeli kusukela koDani kuze kube seBerisheba wazi ukuba uSamuweli umisiwe ukuba abe ngumprofethi weNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yayilokhu ibonakala eShilo, ngoba iNkosi yazibonakalisa kuSamuweli eShilo ngelizwi layo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
